  "details": "Adding Legacy to the name of a shader causes it to fallback locally but all other users can see it normally. For examples we renamed old versions of poiyomi to .poiyomi/Legacy Versions/8.2/Poiyomi and it caused a user to see themselves as a fallback shader but everyone else sees them normally.  The clothes in this image use a shader with legacy in the name.\n\nHappens on both open beta and normal client.",
